@TaskFlow.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5290

### Get all tasks (v1)
GET {{TaskFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/taskitems
Accept: application/json

###

### Get task by ID (v1)
GET {{TaskFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/taskitems/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Create task (v1)
POST {{TaskFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/taskitems
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Task",
  "description": "Testing from .http file",
  "dueDate": "2025-12-31"
}

###

### Update task (v1)
PUT {{TaskFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/taskitems/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Task",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "status": "completed",
  "dueDate": "2025-12-31"
}

###

### Partially update task (v1): only the fields present are changed; null clears description/dueDate
PATCH {{TaskFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/taskitems/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed"
}

###

### Delete task (v1)
DELETE {{TaskFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/taskitems/1

###

### Health check
GET {{TaskFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###